@startuml
!include theme.puml
title Run、事件、工具与授权的事务边界（V3）

participant "Application Service" as App
participant "RunScheduler" as Scheduler
database "Run Store" as RunStore
database "Event Journal" as Journal
database "Tool / Permission Store" as ToolStore
participant "Event Publisher" as Publisher
participant "Observability / Event Bus" as EventBus
participant "AgentRuntime" as Runtime
participant "L1 Action Coordinator / PEP" as Control
participant "ToolRuntime / PermissionSystem" as SecurityServices

App -> RunStore : BEGIN + command receipt 幂等校验
App -> RunStore : INSERT AgentRun(status=ACCEPTED, envelopeRef)
App -> Journal : INSERT RunAccepted(sequence=1)
App -> RunStore : COMMIT
App -> Publisher : 发布已提交事件
App -> Scheduler : enqueue(runId)，仅在提交后调度
Scheduler -> Runtime : RuntimeDispatchPort.dispatch(runId, lease)

Runtime -> App : appendStep / normalizedEvent
App -> RunStore : BEGIN + CAS(runVersion, fenceToken)
App -> Journal : INSERT AgentEvent(nextSequence)
App -> RunStore : UPDATE Run / Attempt
App -> RunStore : COMMIT
App -> Publisher : 发布已提交事件

Runtime -> Control : RuntimeEventPort.publish(ToolCallCandidate)
Control -> SecurityServices : ToolRuntimePort.executeTool(candidate)
SecurityServices -> ToolStore : Repository Ports：各聚合独立 CAS
SecurityServices -> Publisher : 提交后发布 Tool / Permission 领域事件
SecurityServices --> Control : ToolResultRef
Control -> Runtime : RuntimeControlPort.resumeAttempt(ToolResultRef)
Publisher --> EventBus : Event 仅用稳定引用关联 Run

note over RunStore,ToolStore
  每个存储操作都使用 Host 预绑定的不透明分区句柄；
  Kernel 领域模型不携带外部身份或租户业务字段。
end note
@enduml
